      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Rato. Quando fica irritado, Pikachu descarrega imediatamente a energia armazenada nas bolsas de suas bochechas. Quando vários desses Pokémon se reúnem, a eletricidade acumulada pode provocar tempestades de raios.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Pikachu pode evoluir para Raichu no nível 6 ou superior com a ajuda de uma Thunder Stone, ou Raichu de Alola no nível 6 ou superior com a ajuda de uma Alola Stone (fora de Alola) ou uma Thunder Stone (dentro de Alola). Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Charm, Nasty Plot, Sweet Kiss, Tail Whip, Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Play Nice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Double Team</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Iron Tail, Nuzzle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Thunderbolt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Agility, Wild Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Light Screen, Thunder</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Alluring Voice, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Body Slam, Brick Break, Calm Mind, Charge, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dig, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Echoed Voice, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Laser Focus, Light Screen, Magnet Rise, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Nasty Plot, Pay Day, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Rising Voltage, Rock Smash, Round, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Upper Hand, Volt Switch, Volt Tackle, Wild Charge</p>",
